---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Layout><section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT APP STUDIO <span>BY ANKIT SHARMA</span></div><h1>{site.headline.split('\n')[0]}<br/><em>{site.headline.split('\n')[1]}</em></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>{site.intro}</p><a class="button primary" href="#apps">Explore the apps</a></div><div class="hero-index"><span>01 / IDEAS INTO APPS</span><span>CURIOUS BY NATURE.</span></div></section><section id="apps" class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SELECTED WORK / 01</span><h2>Made for the everyday.</h2></div><p>A little less friction.<br/>A little more possibility.</p></div><div class="products">{site.apps.map((app,i)=><article class={`product ${app.accent}`}><a class="product-art" href={`/apps/${app.slug}/`} aria-label={`Explore ${app.name}`}><div class="art-top"><span>{app.category}</span><span>0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{app.tagline.split('\n').map(line=><span>{line}<br/></span>)}</h3><div class="art-bottom"><span class="app-wordmark">{i===0?'go dutch.':'prompt / enhanced'}</span><span>ANDROID APP</span></div></a><div class="product-info"><h3><a href={`/apps/${app.slug}/`}>{app.name}</a></h3><p>{app.description}</p><a class="text-link" href={`/apps/${app.slug}/`}>Discover the app</a></div></article>)}</div></section><section id="journal" class="journal section"><div><span class="eyebrow">NOTES & EXPLORATIONS / 02</span><h2>Curiosity doesn't<br/>end at the code.</h2><p>Ideas, observations, and stories from beyond the apps.</p></div><div class="rows"><a href={site.blogUrl}><span class="row-number">01</span><div><h3>From the journal</h3><p>Articles and stories on Blogger</p></div><span class="pill">READ</span></a><a href={site.githubUrl}><span class="row-number">02</span><div><h3>On the workbench</h3><p>Projects and experiments on GitHub</p></div><span class="pill">EXPLORE</span></a></div></section><section id="about" class="about section"><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE APPS / 03</span><div><h2>One maker.<br/>Many intentions.</h2><div><p>{site.about}</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let's start a conversation</a></div></div></section><section class="closing"><p>Have a thought, a question,<br/>or a better way to do something?</p><a href="/contact/">I'm listening<span>.</span></a></section></Layout>
